 39	                    "room " + room.number() + " takes at most " + room.capacity() + " guests");
 40	        }
 41	        PricingContext pricing =
 42	                new PricingContext(room, request.checkIn(), request.checkOut(), request.companyCode());
 43	        request.ratePlan().validate(pricing);
 44	        boolean roomTaken = store.all().stream()
 45	                .filter(existing -> existing.status() != ReservationStatus.CANCELLED)
 46	                .anyMatch(existing -> existing.overlaps(room.number(), request.checkIn(), request.checkOut()));
 47	        if (roomTaken) {
 48	            throw new HotelException(
 49	                    ErrorCode.ROOM_UNAVAILABLE, "room " + room.number() + " is taken on some of those nights");
 50	        }
 51	        Price price = priceCalculator.calculate(pricing, request.ratePlan());
 52	        Reservation reservation = new Reservation(store.nextId(), request, price);
 53	        store.save(reservation);
